From 333db56172b274faee5c74ca7aff9702b170eca7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: justsisyphus <sisyphus-dev-ai@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Jan 2026 14:09:28 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1137/5749] refactor(agents): remove lsp_diagnostics from
 Sisyphus and Sisyphus-Junior prompts

Orchestrator Sisyphus will handle project-level code validation instead of
having each subagent run file-level lsp_diagnostics.
---
 src/agents/sisyphus-junior.ts | 14 ++++++--------
 src/agents/sisyphus.ts        | 28 ++++++++++------------------
 2 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)

